  "Question": "State the meanings of \\((-3)^3\\) and \\(-3^3\\), and calculate them. (Only write the values of the two expressions in the given order, separated by a comma.)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "-27，-27",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\((-3)^3\\) means multiplying 3 factors of \\((-3)\\), giving \\((-3)\\times(-3)\\times(-3)=-27\\). The expression \\(-3^3\\) means the additive inverse of \\(3^3\\), giving \\(-(3\\times3\\times3)=-27\\).",
